# Provide one or more Groq API keys. The extractor rotates across all of
# them, skipping a key immediately once it looks rate-limited, so a single
# key's per-minute/per-day limit does not break a long extraction run.
#
# Any of the following forms work, and can be combined:

# 1) Single key
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here

# 2) Comma-separated list (any number of keys)
# GROQ_API_KEYS=key_one,key_two,key_three

# 3) Numbered keys (any count, sequential from 1)
GROQ_API_KEY_1=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
GROQ_API_KEY_2=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
GROQ_API_KEY_3=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
GROQ_API_KEY_4=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
